    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 Nominated for multiple VR Game of the Year awards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Floor Plan 2</strong> is a comedy adventure inspired by escape rooms, packed with more puzzles than you can fit in an elevator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On your first day of work, the boss sends you to find a lost treasure that will turn the company's fortunes around. And good news: it's somewhere in the building! Just use the elevator down the hall. By the way, each floor is a gateway to another world, nobody speaks your language, and time and space are fluid. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/6495e502a36961916df15367da81938e.poster.avif?t=1744669722\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/6495e502a36961916df15367da81938e.webm?t=1744669722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/6495e502a36961916df15367da81938e.mp4?t=1744669722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HILARIOUS, MIND-BENDING PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your elevator to explore a series of interconnected escape rooms. Step out onto each floor, meet bizarre characters, and unravel their secrets. Revisit completed floors to find new, remixed challenges waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/1bcbe295d4c19f3b940393e6ee58bb96.poster.avif?t=1744669722\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/1bcbe295d4c19f3b940393e6ee58bb96.webm?t=1744669722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/1bcbe295d4c19f3b940393e6ee58bb96.mp4?t=1744669722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HAND PRESENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find Red Harrys, lost critters hidden throughout the building, to earn hand presents and transform your hands in all sorts of unexpected ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/711012364456f4309d55ad90e5d44502.poster.avif?t=1744669722\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/711012364456f4309d55ad90e5d44502.webm?t=1744669722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/711012364456f4309d55ad90e5d44502.mp4?t=1744669722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">6+ HOURS OF HANDCRAFTED GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Filled with critically-acclaimed puzzles and memorable &quot;aha!&quot; moments that respect your time and intelligence. Now includes the Backside Story expansion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/5d9b3b68ca02e656af0d88a5a81ae300.poster.avif?t=1744669722\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/5d9b3b68ca02e656af0d88a5a81ae300.webm?t=1744669722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/5d9b3b68ca02e656af0d88a5a81ae300.mp4?t=1744669722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHARMING-AS-HECK WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built for VR, comfortable for everyone, and developed with love by the small but mighty Turbo Button team.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 Nominated for multiple VR Game of the Year awards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Floor Plan 2</strong> is a comedy adventure inspired by escape rooms, packed with more puzzles than you can fit in an elevator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On your first day of work, the boss sends you to find a lost treasure that will turn the company's fortunes around. And good news: it's somewhere in the building! Just use the elevator down the hall. By the way, each floor is a gateway to another world, nobody speaks your language, and time and space are fluid. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/6495e502a36961916df15367da81938e.poster.avif?t=1744669722\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/6495e502a36961916df15367da81938e.webm?t=1744669722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/6495e502a36961916df15367da81938e.mp4?t=1744669722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HILARIOUS, MIND-BENDING PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your elevator to explore a series of interconnected escape rooms. Step out onto each floor, meet bizarre characters, and unravel their secrets. Revisit completed floors to find new, remixed challenges waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/1bcbe295d4c19f3b940393e6ee58bb96.poster.avif?t=1744669722\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/1bcbe295d4c19f3b940393e6ee58bb96.webm?t=1744669722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/1bcbe295d4c19f3b940393e6ee58bb96.mp4?t=1744669722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HAND PRESENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find Red Harrys, lost critters hidden throughout the building, to earn hand presents and transform your hands in all sorts of unexpected ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/711012364456f4309d55ad90e5d44502.poster.avif?t=1744669722\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/711012364456f4309d55ad90e5d44502.webm?t=1744669722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/711012364456f4309d55ad90e5d44502.mp4?t=1744669722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">6+ HOURS OF HANDCRAFTED GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Filled with critically-acclaimed puzzles and memorable &quot;aha!&quot; moments that respect your time and intelligence. Now includes the Backside Story expansion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/5d9b3b68ca02e656af0d88a5a81ae300.poster.avif?t=1744669722\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/5d9b3b68ca02e656af0d88a5a81ae300.webm?t=1744669722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/5d9b3b68ca02e656af0d88a5a81ae300.mp4?t=1744669722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHARMING-AS-HECK WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built for VR, comfortable for everyone, and developed with love by the small but mighty Turbo Button team.</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore a tower of hilarious escape rooms and solve mind-bending puzzles in this absurd elevator adventure for virtual reality. Step out onto each floor, meet bizarre characters, unravel their secrets, and figure out how everything is connected to find the lost artifacts your boss is looking for.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America",
    "reviews": "\u201cFloor Plan 2 feels like a VR episode of The Muppet Show, not just in the hilarious absurdity of its world but also in the constant, invigorating ingenuity of its puzzles.\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 Upload VR<br><br>\u201cThis is one of the best puzzle games in VR.\u201d<br>A Wolf in VR<br><br>\u201cI absolutely adore this game.\u201d<br>4.8/5 \u2013 The Escape Roomer<br>",
